    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS APPLICATION OF STATISTICS",
    "describe_ch": "This course presents several basic statistical techniques which are frequently used by managers to students. Some relatively simple practical examples will be provided to students for practicing these techniques. Students may need a laptop with Microsoft Excel to perform the calculations associated with these statistical techniques. Students will know how to analyze and interpret the results and the output from Excel.",
